  "details": "So an idea that's been floated by the community is for world creators to have ways of having persistence data be carried over to other worlds. This would actually be useful as I'm sure there are various cases where world creators would want some persistence data to be carried over between their worlds. One example would be for those that would make an MMO within VRC or have high scores between specific games be carried into other worlds.",
